-- Spatial recurrence (ex46): a fresh line stays zero under iteration. Twin of 46-spatial-recurrence.bqn (second assertion).
-- Iterate the step on a fresh line and nothing ever happens: zero in, zero out, eight times over.
-- Eight barriers of the Version A stencil on an all-zero pre-state: k statements are k stencil steps, every read observes that statement's pre-state, so a freshly minted line stays zero forever.
--! registry ../registries/46-spatial-recurrence-b.reg
--! expect height = 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0

Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
